{"id":"23fc3019079f617c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HeytingAlgebra.md","title":"HeytingAlgebra","display":"HeytingAlgebra","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"HeytingAlgebra","parameters":["D","R","m","j","h","z","o"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"HeytingAlgebra"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>R</span><span>m</span><span>j</span><span>h</span><span>z</span><span>o</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Heyting 代数语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>m</code>、<code>j</code>、<code>h</code>、<code>z</code>、<code>o</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ HeytingAlgebra D R m j h z o)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Nonempty D)\n  (and\n    (@ RelationOn D R)\n    (and\n      (@ Reflexive D R)\n      (and\n        (@ Transitive D R)\n        (and\n          (@ Antisymmetric D R)\n          (and\n            (in z D)\n            (and\n              (in o D)\n              (and\n                (forall a (implies (in a D) (and (@ Edge R z a) (@ Edge R a o))))\n                (and\n                  (@ BinaryOperation D m)\n                  (and\n                    (@ BinaryOperation D j)\n                    (and\n                      (@ BinaryOperation D h)\n                      (and\n                        (forall a\n                          (implies\n                            (in a D)\n                            (forall b\n                            (implies\n                            (in b D)\n                            (forall c\n                            (implies\n                            (@ BinaryValue m a b c)\n                            (forall x (implies (in x D) (iff (@ Edge R x c) (and (@ Edge R x a) (@ Edge R x b)))))))))))\n                        (and\n                          (forall a\n                            (implies\n                            (in a D)\n                            (forall b\n                            (implies\n                            (in b D)\n                            (forall c\n                            (implies\n                            (@ BinaryValue j a b c)\n                            (forall x (implies (in x D) (iff (@ Edge R c x) (and (@ Edge R a x) (@ Edge R b x)))))))))))\n                          (forall a\n                            (implies\n                            (in a D)\n                            (forall b\n                            (implies\n                            (in b D)\n                            (forall c\n                            (implies\n                            (in c D)\n                            (exists ab\n                            (exists bc\n                            (and (@ BinaryValue m a b ab) (and (@ BinaryValue h b c bc) (iff (@ Edge R ab c) (@ Edge R a bc)))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2cf2b5d9a275968b\" href=\"?note=2cf2b5d9a275968b\" title=\"ZFC_Antisymmetric\">Antisymmetric</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dabaeab9f2d90e9c\" href=\"?note=dabaeab9f2d90e9c\" title=\"ZFC_BinaryOperation\">BinaryOperation</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8175e0e33cb0689c\" href=\"?note=8175e0e33cb0689c\" title=\"ZFC_BinaryValue\">BinaryValue</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe68ff8d3284eeda\" href=\"?note=fe68ff8d3284eeda\" title=\"ZFC_Nonempty\">Nonempty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"31def2a0ecebb8cf\" href=\"?note=31def2a0ecebb8cf\" title=\"ZFC_Reflexive\">Reflexive</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" href=\"?note=cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" title=\"ZFC_RelationOn\">RelationOn</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2b88fdcc29f28660\" href=\"?note=2b88fdcc29f28660\" title=\"ZFC_Transitive\">Transitive</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ HeytingAlgebra D R m j h z o)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Antisymmetric","status":"resolved","id":"2cf2b5d9a275968b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Antisymmetric|Antisymmetric]]；[[ZFC_BinaryOperation|BinaryOperation]]；[[ZFC_BinaryValue|BinaryValue]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_BinaryOperation","status":"resolved","id":"dabaeab9f2d90e9c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Antisymmetric|Antisymmetric]]；[[ZFC_BinaryOperation|BinaryOperation]]；[[ZFC_BinaryValue|BinaryValue]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]